Mixed-model repeated-measures least-square means: A mixed-effects model for the imputed weight outcome at week 72 was created, including the same fixed covariates as in the genetic analysis, as well as visit, and a subject-level random effect. The least-square means estimands were generated for the three-way interaction for MC4R carrier status, pooled treatment (collapsed 5, 10 and 15 mg treatment groups versus placebo) and visit. Week 72 visit estimands were plotted to visualize the single-time-point treatment and MC4R LoF carrier interaction effect (Fig. 1b), while estimands from all available visits were plotted over time to illustrate the visit interaction effect (Fig. 1c).

